      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ON TARGET (2) struggled for best form latest, finishing 7th (22.46) in a Grade 4/5 at this track. Goes very well at course and distance boasting five wins. Got the money at his only try from this box. Should be very hard to beat this time. TIGER BAILEY (1) was out of the placings last time but shapes well for this on his brilliant win the start prior, getting around this track over 380m in 21.74. Should be in this for a long way. SUNSET BOY (8) turned in a plain performance last time when eighth at this track over 380m behind Ground Control (22.56) in a Grade 4. Should be thereabouts. MIZUKI FLASH (6) has strong credentials over this journey.",
